e=A.d(f?"For each attached screenshot, the app scans the Wave receipt. It reads the recipient when printed, the net amount, the ID, the date, the status and the customer number. It reads the ID itself. The member has nothing to copy. It compares everything with the request. Warning: on the Wave Business receipt model, the merchant account is not printed. The scan cannot verify the recipient from that document. It says so. Checking in the structure\u2019s Wave Business account remains required. The field below is for receipts that print a recipient. The structure writes the name or number shown as recipient on its Wave account. As long as this field is empty, the scan reports an unverifiable recipient, structure check required. It never validates the recipient alone.":"\xc0 chaque capture jointe, l\u2019application scanne le re\xe7u Wave. Elle lit le destinataire quand il est imprim\xe9, le montant net, l\u2019identifiant, la date, le statut et le num\xe9ro du client. Elle lit l\u2019identifiant elle-m\xeame. Le membre n\u2019a rien \xe0 copier. Elle compare le tout \xe0 la demande. Attention. Sur le mod\xe8le de re\xe7u Wave Business, le compte marchand n\u2019est pas imprim\xe9. Le scan ne peut pas v\xe9rifier le destinataire \xe0 partir de ce document. Il le dit. Le contr\xf4le dans le compte Wave Business de la structure reste requis. Le champ ci-dessous sert aux re\xe7us qui impriment un destinataire. La structure y \xe9crit le nom ou le num\xe9ro affich\xe9 comme destinataire sur son compte Wave. Tant que ce champ est vide, le scan signale destinataire non v\xe9rifiable, contr\xf4le de la structure requis. Il ne valide jamais seul le destinataire.",a1,a1,a1,a1,p,a1,a1,a1)
